On 9/19/06, Angel Ramirez <angel.ramirez.isea@gmail.com> wrote:
> Matt: Thanks for all the info. I'm planning to subscribe to the beginners
> list. One little question: what is this list for? Just so that we know how
> many we are? :P

Angel,

Anything goes on this list if there is some kind of relationship with
Lojban. We also sometimes talk about linguistics, psychology,
philosophy, logic, mathematics, computer science, anthropology,
sociology, education, and human biology, but mostly it's connected to
Lojban in some way.

The only thing we really want to avoid here is teaching the beginning
level of the language on this main list. And the more difficult and
confusing topics are kept off the beginner's list.

-epkat


